  "body": "Fork synced at v0.18.0.\n\n## What changed\n\nFifth slice of #1250: a reference page for the Wire EDM group, `site/content/guide/operations-edm.md`, in the shape of the other `operations-*.md` pages. `KindInfo::ALL` on upstream/main has one kind in `Section::WireEdm` - **Wire Contour** (#532) - so that is the one kind covered. Sinker EDM has no operation on main yet (the sinker kinds are in #1131), and the wire skims/tabs/taper are still in open PRs, so neither is documented.\n\nThe page covers:\n- the machine, wire and post: a declared `wire_edm` machine file (none ships), no library tool, the wire diameter and spark gap from `edm.conditions`, no EDM post yet, what the machine check and Simulate do and do not judge;\n- the settings by tab with their seed defaults (Side: Die; Start hole stated: off, X/Y 0/0 when ticked; Top/Bottom of workpiece: model top/bottom; Condition: none chosen), read from `wire_op::seed_wire_contour` and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/wire_page.rs`; no Lead in / Lead out or Feeds tab (`op_tabs::has_section`);\n- picks (one closed profile, or the model's through-silhouette);\n- the refusals, quoted from `operation/wire_op.rs`, `commands/operation/gates.rs`, `post/src/machine/edm_conditions.rs`, `motion/src/wire_edm/{mod,ring,laws}.rs`, `posting_family.rs` and `stock_sim_wire.rs`.\n\nLinked from `guide/operations.md` (kinds table gains Plasma and Wire EDM rows; the per-family reference list names the new page) and from the EDM section of `guide/machines.md`. The guide index lists it by its `weight = 5` front matter, like its siblings. All links are `@/guide/<page>.md` to pages on main.\n\n## How tested\n\n`zola build` (0.23.6) in `site/`: green - \"Creating 37 pages (0 orphan) and 3 sections\". Docs-only: no Rust build or test run.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo toolpath pictures (still owed on #1250).\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: high\n\nRefs #1250\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
